{{Quote|''A condensed form of rock only found at extreme depths.''}}
'''Hard Stone''' is a {{Common}} Block found in the [[Crystal Hollows]], [[Glacite Tunnels]], and [[Glacite Mineshafts]].

== Collection ==
{{/Collection UI}}

{{CollectionTable|Hard Stone}}

Note: {{Item|Yog Armor}} is also unlocked at {{Coll|Hard Stone 5}} (5), but it isn't listed.

== Obtaining ==
'''Hard Stone''' can be obtained by mining {{Item|Stone}} blocks in the [[Crystal Hollows]], [[Glacite Tunnels]], or [[Glacite Mineshafts]] (or or {{Item|Cyan Hardened Clay}} blocks in the [[Crystal Hollows]]) using a [[Pickaxe]], [[Gauntlet]], or [[Drill]] with a {{Stat|Breaking Power}} of at least {{Green|4}}.

The {{Item|Cyan Hardened Clay}} variant only appears in the [[Crystal Hollows]]. In other areas, it is {{Item|Mithril}} instead.

